  "id": "null-hypothesis",
  "term": "null hypothesis",
  "definition": "A null hypothesis is the statement examined in significance testing, usually proposing that a value is zero or that there is no difference between groups or parameters. Studies are commonly set up to see whether this hypothesis can be rejected.",
